        <comment>
      The Psyche mission dictionary contains classes and attributes specific
      to the Psyche spacecraft and its instruments.

      Psyche version 1.1.0.0

      2025-01-29 Completed initial version for flight [Ernest Cisneros]
      2026-10-29 Addition of Magnetometer and Imager specific attributes.
                 Imager attributes based on Imager label work by SDC and
                 Magnetometer attributes were suggested by Matt Wall (MIT/Mag),
                 as relayed to Lauren Auchterlonie (ASU/SDC). [Ernest Cisneros]
                 Also added new super-class Psyche_Mission to contain the
                 Psyche_Parameters, Magnetometer_Parameters and Imager_Parameters
                 classes.
    </comment>
    <last_modification_date_time>2026-10-29T12:15:51Z</last_modification_date_time>

