	             present, it must begin with a partition number followed by a forward slash, or the clock partition must be given by
	             psyche:spacecraft_clock_partition. </rule_message>
	            <rule_description>If the spacecraft_clock_start is present, it must begin with a partition
                      number followed by a forward slash, or the partition number must be given by spacecraft_clock_partition</rule_description>
